 "glossary": "GitHub. One command per line: <words> [owner/repo or owner/repo#N] [values] [key=value].\nWord order is free; plurals and synonyms are fine (prs, issues, show=get, edit=update, find=search, pull request=pr). #N is the issue/PR number.\nQuote text with spaces and any path containing '/'. Lists: a,b,c. Paging: page= perPage= (after=<cursor> where noted).\n  pr       get | list [state=open|closed|all base= head= sort=created|updated|popularity|long-running direction=asc|desc] | search <query> | create <title> head= base= [body= draft= reviewers=a,b modify=] | update [title= body= state=open|closed base= draft= reviewers=] | close | merge [method=merge|squash|rebase title= message= sha=] | approve [body=] | update pr branch | request copilot review\n  pr views #N: pr diff | status | files | commits | comments | reviews | review comments [after=] | checks\n  review   create #N [event=APPROVE|REQUEST_CHANGES|COMMENT body= commit=] (no event = pending) | submit #N [event= body=] | delete #N (pending)\n           add review comment #N <path> <body> subject=LINE|FILE [line= side=LEFT|RIGHT start= startside=]\n  thread   resolve|unresolve #N <threadId PRRT_...>\n  issue    get | list [state=open|closed labels= since= orderBy=CREATED_AT|UPDATED_AT|COMMENTS direction=ASC|DESC after=] | search <natural-language query> | create <title> [body= labels= assignees= milestone= type= parent=<number>] | update #N [title= body= state=open|closed reason=completed|not_planned|duplicate duplicate_of= labels= assignees=] | close #N [reason=]\n  issue views #N: issue comments | labels | parent ; subissues ; issue types | fields (owner/repo or owner=)\n  subissue add|remove #parent <sub_issue_id> [replace=true] | reorder #parent <sub_issue_id> after=|before=<id>\n  comment  add #N <body> | update <comment_id> <body> | reply #PR <commentId> [body] [reaction=] ; react #N <+1|-1|laugh|confused|heart|hooray|rocket|eyes> [comment=<id>]\n  copilot  assign copilot #issue [base= instructions=]\n  file     get|list [path] [ref= sha=] | create|update <path> <content> branch= message= [sha= needed to update] | delete <path> branch= message= | push branch= message= files='[{\"path\":\"a\",\"content\":\"x\"}]'\n  repo     create <name> [private= init= org= description=] (no target) | fork [org=] | search <query> [sort=stars|forks|updated]\n  branch   list | create <name> [from=]\n  commit   get <sha> [detail=none|stats|full_patch] | list [branch= author= path= since= until=] | search <query>\n  tag      list | get <tag>      release  list | get <tag> | get latest release\n  label    list | get <name>     milestone|assignee|reviewer list     collaborator list [affiliation=outside|direct|all]\n  other    search code <query> | search user <query> | get me | list team [user=] | team members <org>/<team-slug>\nExamples:\nget pr octo/app#12\npr files octo/app#12\ncreate issue octo/app \"Login fails\" labels=bug,auth\nmerge pr octo/app#12 method=squash",
